    "detailed_description": "Condition-reasoning gravity puzzle!<br><br>All you can do is <strong>manipulate gravity</strong>.<br>Each stage has a number of circles, which grow larger under certain conditions.<br>But the conditions are <strong>different</strong> for each stage, and you have to guess each time.<br>If you can make all the circles bigger, you have cleared the stage.<br><br>You can guess the conditions of stage 1 just by watching the play movie above.<br>This should give you some idea of how the game works.<br><br>There are only 8 stages, but all of them are not easy to solve.<br>Even if you are familiar with puzzles, it will probably take you an hour to clear all of them.<br><br>If you like puzzles, please give it a try.",
